#: docs/app/content/guide/what-is-ardo.mdx
msgid ""
"<0>Nextra</0> is a strong choice for Next.js teams. It combines MDX with "
"Next.js routing, optimized links and images, search, i18n, and the rendering "
"options you expect from the Next ecosystem."
msgstr ""
"<0>Nextra</0> combina MDX con rutas Next.js, enlaces e imágenes optimizados, "
"búsqueda, i18n y los modos de renderizado de Next."

#: docs/app/content/compare/nimbus.mdx
