msgstr ""
"<0>nimbus-docs check y lint</0>, con correcciones y comprobaciones de "
"actualizaciones."

#: docs/app/content/guide/what-is-ardo.mdx
msgid ""
"<0>Nimbus</0> also keeps docs in your repository and serves people and agents."
" It gives you scaffolded Astro UI files and a deep OpenAPI reference; Ardo "
"uses React pages and packaged UI, with native TypeScript API documentation. "
"The dedicated comparison covers ownership, agent services, hosting, and "
"migration work."
msgstr ""
"<0>Nimbus</0> también conserva la documentación en tu repositorio para "
"personas y agentes. Ofrece archivos de interfaz Astro y una referencia OpenAPI"
