"<2/>. Los nombres conocidos (<3/>, <4/>, <5/>, <6/>, <7/>) reciben etiqueta e "
"icono; los demás conservan el nombre de carpeta. La pestaña abre el índice "
"o la primera página."

#: docs/app/content/guide/configuration.mdx
msgid ""
"Each version can declare <0/>: omit it to preserve the current locale, use "
"<1/> for an unlocalized archive, or list supported locale IDs to retain the "
"current language when available and otherwise choose the first supported "
"language. The version switcher sits at the end of the sidebar, in the footer "
"of bare pages, and in the menu on narrow screens. List versions newest first: "
"the first entry counts as the latest version, and the pages of every other "
"version show a banner that links to the same page in the latest one."
msgstr ""
