#: docs/app/content/guide/configuration.mdx
msgid ""
"External links are out of scope, because their availability depends on "
"third-party servers rather than on the build. Links to the other versions in "
"<0><1/></0> count as present, because each version is deployed on its own. A "
"link that leaves the deployment base, such as <2/> on a site served below "
"<3/>, is reported. Each finding names the file and line it comes from."
msgstr ""
"Los enlaces externos se excluyen porque su disponibilidad depende de "
"servidores ajenos. Las otras versiones de <0><1/></0> se consideran presentes "
"porque se despliegan por separado. Se informa de un enlace fuera de la base de"
" despliegue, como <2/> en un sitio servido bajo <3/>. Cada aviso indica "
"archivo y línea."

