#: docs/app/content/guide/layout-and-navigation.mdx
msgid ""
"If the bootstrap script or one of its static dependencies never loads or fails"
" during module evaluation, the recovery code cannot run: the static HTML and "
"native links remain the fallback. The existing cancelable <0/> event still "
"lets a site take over a page-chunk failure; calling <1/> leaves recovery to "
"that listener. This contract does not catch arbitrary async callbacks, "
"event-handler exceptions, or errors already handled by a site's own React "
"boundary. Use a released Ardo version containing this capability before "
"relying on it in a consumer site."
msgstr ""
"Si el script de arranque o una de sus dependencias estáticas no se carga o "
"falla al evaluar el módulo, el código de recuperación no puede ejecutarse: "
"el HTML estático y los enlaces nativos siguen siendo la alternativa. El "
"evento cancelable <0/> existente permite al sitio gestionar un error de carga "
"de un fragmento de página; llamar a <1/> deja la recuperación a ese "
