"in CI (for example, <0/> with <1/>); source archives and files without history"
" fall back to filesystem modification times. A build from a copy of the "
"project reads the original's history with <2><3/></2>. Dates use the site's "
"language and UTC unless a different time zone is supplied in <4/>. Generated "
"API pages disable edit links and file dates. Materialized content disables "
"them by default; its frontmatter mapping can opt in when a meaningful source "
"pattern is configured."
msgstr ""
