#: docs/app/content/guide/configuration.mdx
msgid ""
"Omitting <0/> retains the original whole-site behavior. Adopting directory "
"selection changes URLs for pages outside the selected areas: configure "
"explicit redirects for former versioned site URLs and reorganize mixed "
"directories before enabling it. Retained historical builds are not rewritten "
"automatically. Shared assets stay under the deployment root in this mode."
