#: docs/app/content/guide/publications.mdx
msgid ""
"This gives the site homepage <0/>, posts <1/>, and guides <2/>. All URLs also "
"respect a deployment <3/>. Without <4/>, existing projects retain whole-site "
"versioning. See <5>configuration</5> for migration behavior."
msgstr ""
